OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm construction to begin
OL,4,Ain November
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to build a 43,000 panel solar farm
OL,7,Fis to begin in November, after a
OL,8,Fcontract was signed with a
OL,9,Fcarbon-neutral developer.
OL,11,FThe farm will power 9,400 homes, and
OL,12,Fwill be built on farmland to the south
OL,13,Fof Barkham, Berkshire, owned by
OL,14,FWokingham Borough Council.
OL,16,FThe facility is expected to go live and
OL,17,Fstart generating electricity in
OL,18,FSeptember 2027, with full connectivity
OL,19,Fexpected by 2029.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
