OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm construction to begin
OL,4,Ain November
OL,5,
OL,6,FImogen Shepherd-DuBey, the council's
OL,7,Fexecutive member for finance and
OL,8,Fgovernance, said signing the contract
OL,9,Fwith Equans was an "important step
OL,10,Fforward for the council".
